                "markdown": "Upgrade axios to 0.21.2 or later.\n\nA06:2021 Vulnerable and Outdated Components: https://owasp.org/Top10/A06_2021-Vulnerable_and_Outdated_Components/\n\nCWE-1333 Regular Expression DoS: https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1333.html"
